{"4118190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OURATH: a Place in Peace", "steam_appid": 4118190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OURATH: a Place in Peace- A Singleplayer, Multi-Ending, Deck Building Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/6fab4c6fcc1a7feb03db843b26039ce2.avif?t=1777046429\" width=1471 height=526 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality has arrived at its final moment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sources have fallen out of balance, and as the worlds strain under the weight of heavy ashen rain, existence itself promises to be lost beneath black tides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/26022fbf48b7b5681488b5469ccdfdce.avif?t=1777046429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras_big/26022fbf48b7b5681488b5469ccdfdce.avif?t=1777046429 width=1560 height=586 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be witness to the end of history, enter the rite of power, follow the paths, and live again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/1ca2de43d9bc1b0ea1c2b493cee61936.poster.avif?t=1777046429\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/1ca2de43d9bc1b0ea1c2b493cee61936.webm?t=1777046429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/1ca2de43d9bc1b0ea1c2b493cee61936.mp4?t=1777046429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remains of the dying mortal plane, growing in sorcerous power as you put its cold headstones to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/76d18308cd99ba26f8aef419b0bf250a.poster.avif?t=1777046429\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/76d18308cd99ba26f8aef419b0bf250a.webm?t=1777046429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/76d18308cd99ba26f8aef419b0bf250a.mp4?t=1777046429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel abyssal, ancient, and ruinous forces to strengthen yourself, destroy your foes, and summon forth minions from the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/e3c77677ed11c0ad80c9d0331c459a3d.avif?t=1777046429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras_big/e3c77677ed11c0ad80c9d0331c459a3d.webp?t=1777046429 width=1560 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your combat experience with 54 unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/113ab6c76cae6ba5c9bf349007d709fb.avif?t=1777046429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras_big/113ab6c76cae6ba5c9bf349007d709fb.avif?t=1777046429 width=1560 height=586 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the most deeply buried secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal your true identity, nature, and name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring light to a lightless world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;...For one once saw and heard and knew, that life is lies, and dreams are true.&quot;</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OURATH: a Place in Peace- A Singleplayer, Multi-Ending, Deck Building Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/6fab4c6fcc1a7feb03db843b26039ce2.avif?t=1777046429\" width=1471 height=526 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality has arrived at its final moment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sources have fallen out of balance, and as the worlds strain under the weight of heavy ashen rain, existence itself promises to be lost beneath black tides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/26022fbf48b7b5681488b5469ccdfdce.avif?t=1777046429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras_big/26022fbf48b7b5681488b5469ccdfdce.avif?t=1777046429 width=1560 height=586 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be witness to the end of history, enter the rite of power, follow the paths, and live again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/1ca2de43d9bc1b0ea1c2b493cee61936.poster.avif?t=1777046429\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/1ca2de43d9bc1b0ea1c2b493cee61936.webm?t=1777046429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/1ca2de43d9bc1b0ea1c2b493cee61936.mp4?t=1777046429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remains of the dying mortal plane, growing in sorcerous power as you put its cold headstones to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/76d18308cd99ba26f8aef419b0bf250a.poster.avif?t=1777046429\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/76d18308cd99ba26f8aef419b0bf250a.webm?t=1777046429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/76d18308cd99ba26f8aef419b0bf250a.mp4?t=1777046429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel abyssal, ancient, and ruinous forces to strengthen yourself, destroy your foes, and summon forth minions from the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/e3c77677ed11c0ad80c9d0331c459a3d.avif?t=1777046429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras_big/e3c77677ed11c0ad80c9d0331c459a3d.webp?t=1777046429 width=1560 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your combat experience with 54 unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras/113ab6c76cae6ba5c9bf349007d709fb.avif?t=1777046429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/extras_big/113ab6c76cae6ba5c9bf349007d709fb.avif?t=1777046429 width=1560 height=586 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the most deeply buried secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal your true identity, nature, and name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring light to a lightless world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;...For one once saw and heard and knew, that life is lies, and dreams are true.&quot;</p>", "short_description": "Enter the dark and dying world of Ourath, a Place in Peace. Build a deck of powerful magical abilities and battle twisted foes in strategic, turn-based combat across dozens of pixel-art landscapes. Uncover buried truths as you navigate these cursed lands, where the sky weeps, and ashes fall as rain.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/5abec0b7a4977cae18a5f862047dfbf28b29c65f/header.jpg?t=1777046429", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/70aa0cd6af0af7e87853429079a3915c900a07c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777046429", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118190/70aa0cd6af0af7e87853429079a3915c900a07c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777046429", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 G<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card</li></ul>", "recommended": "